.098039 .176471 .219608 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 33.5 Tm /F3+0 11.5 Tf 15 TL (Large daily stock returns often cluster in time. GARCH estimates how strongly return shocks affect variance) Tj T* (and how long their effects last. Does this improve next-day variance forecasts over rolling variance or an) Tj T* (exponentially weighted moving average \(EWMA\)? We test this on SPY, an ETF tracking the S&P 500.) Tj T* ET
