BT 1 0 0 1 0 33.5 Tm /F3+0 11.5 Tf 15 TL (We compute daily log returns from SPY adjusted closing prices. We implement the variance recursions in) Tj T* -0.068377 Tw (Python and estimate Gaussian and standardized Student\001s t GARCH\(1,1\) by maximum likelihood. Both use the) Tj T* 0 Tw (previous squared return shock and the previous variance forecast.) Tj T* ET
