.098039 .176471 .219608 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 33.5 Tm /F3+0 11.5 Tf 15 TL (We train on 2010\0022015 and select the rolling window \(60 trading days\) and EWMA decay \(0.94\) on) Tj T* (2016\0022018. We refit GARCH on 2010\0022018, then hold coefficients fixed throughout testing. Each forecast) Tj T* (uses only past returns. We score it against the next day\001s squared deviation from the pretest mean return.) Tj T* ET
